description:
ts
interface Interface {
 method(): void;
}
export class Class implements Interface {
 property = "yadda";
 /*$*/
}
Request completions at `/*$*/` with the following set to `true`
* `includeCompletionsWithSnippetText`
* `includeCompletionsWithClassMemberSnippets`
**Expected**: We should offer to auto-complete `method`.
**Actual**: Only keyword completions!
![image](

