Looking at the reports, it seems we were able to find another reproducer for what seems to be related to #46364, #44051, and #43832. This bug has been found when building TypeScript from the main branch and running the `fuzz_compiler.js` [link]( on it. I attached a PoC below that isolates the issue to the call to `ts.createSourceFile(fileName, fileContent, ts.ScriptTarget.Latest);`.
Happy to answer any questions and also discuss the used APIs.
